        <mxCell id="a-note" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;A new task is not free&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pull the image, start the process, pass two health checks. Capacity you need in ten seconds has to be running before the ten seconds start.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
